On which subset of $RR$ does the sequence of functions $f_n(x) = x^n$ converge pointwise, and where does it converge uniformly?

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
Pointwise on $(-1, 1]$; uniformly on any $[a, b] subset (-1, 1)$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
Pointwise on $(-1, 1)$; uniformly on $(-1, 1)$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
Pointwise on $[-1, 1]$; uniformly on $[-1, 1]$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
Pointwise on $RR$; uniformly on $[0, 1]$

